{'symbol': 'PHM', 'date': '2023-03-08 08:30:00', 'title': 'PULTEGROUP ENTERS GREENVILLE, SOUTH CAROLINA MARKET', 'text': 'ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PULTEGROUP, INC. (NYSE: PHM) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS EXPANSION INTO THE GREENVILLE MARKET, BEGINNING WITH THREE NEW CONSTRUCTION COMMUNITIES UNDER ITS PULTE HOMES BRAND. THE FIRST COMMUNITY, INDIGO PARK LOCATED IN EASLEY, WILL GRAND OPEN THIS SUMMER. BRIARWOOD RESERVE IN SPARTANBURG IS SET TO OPEN IN LATE 2023, FOLLOWED BY THE OPENING OF ALSTON PARK IN GREENVILLE IN EARLY 2024.'}